{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple fighting game distilling the core essence of 3D fighting games! And yet, it's 2D...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distilling the essence of 3D fighting games, 2Deez is the perfect starting point, or grinding point, for someone who really wants to understand 3D fighting games as a subgenre.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story mode with 10 chapters, featuring characters such as a cursed rat, a cotton candy monster, and a cabal of evil wizards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own custom palette... with <strong><u>HATS!!!1!!1</u></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline Play with Bots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline Versus Mode for local play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online lobby play with Rollback Netcode, chat, and spectators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replays to watch the games you've played, with replay takeover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-Game command list with frame data</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An in-depth training mode with hitbox viewer, frame data display, a macro editor, and ability to save training macros to json files</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you dig deep, and are willing to work with json files, the ability to make and fight against your own bots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...A Discord server! Find the link on the DON!DON!GAME Youtube channel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Candyman Hammereth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3583000/c8d20f9f050457006f64804574486aeff065f104.jpg"},{"name":"Take out the trash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3583000/13e97d68c78e0e3987c6d51dfdba788b8f0dbb18.jpg"},{"name":"D